{
  "name": "Daily Rakuten cashback rates to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily Rakuten cashback rates to Google Sheets\n\nEvery morning, appends the current cashback rate of Rakuten stores to a Google Sheet, using the [Rakuten Cashback Scraper](https://apify.com/Smart-Shopping-Data/rakuten-cashback-scraper) Apify Actor. Over time the sheet becomes a rate history you can chart.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create an *HTTP Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. In **Get Rakuten rates**, choose stores with `storeKeywords` or raise `maxStores` (0 = all ~4,200 stores, about 35 minutes).\n3. Create a sheet with the header row `store, rateText, rateType, rateValue, isUpTo, storeId, url, checkedAt`, then connect Google Sheets in **Append to sheet**.\n\nCost: $0.002 per store row.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every day at 7am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/kohDcDyVSMZK6Uuso/run-sync-get-dataset-items?timeout=300",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"maxStores\": 0,\n  \"storeKeywords\": [\n    \"nike\",\n    \"sephora\",\n    \"walmart\",\n    \"bestbuy\",\n    \"target\",\n    \"macys\",\n    \"expedia\"\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 330000
        }
      },
      "name": "Get Rakuten rates",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token (Authorization: Bearer ...)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Append to sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every day at 7am": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Rakuten rates",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Rakuten rates": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Append to sheet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}